錯的，以後會想要帶媽媽來吃。\n\n份量還挺大的，一碗拉麵裡面那厚厚的百葉兩塊就把我給弄飽了，雖然多，我們還是有加套餐，另外品嚐了三種不同的小菜：炸杏鮑菇我覺得是第一名，玉子燒口感很好，味道偏甜，再一個藍帶起司，很有特色！\n\n套餐的小菜一起分享，各自再吃一碗麵，我們三個人AA一個人吃下來四百多台幣。\n\n店裡面的座位還挺多的，有洗手間，方便。\n服務很親切。",null,[0,60]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15943577517523358854/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZUdWR1pHbFdhMHBMWlZWc1IySnJSakZNVjAxNlZEQm9RbUZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15943577517523358854/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZUdWR1pHbFdhMHBMWlZWc1IySnJSakZNVjAxNlZEQm9RbUZGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15943577517523358854/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZUdWR1pHbFdhMHBMWlZWc1IySnJSakZNVjAxNlZEQm9RbUZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15943577517523358854/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZUdWR1pHbFdhMHBMWlZWc1IySnJSakZNVjAxNlZEQm9RbUZGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15943577517523358854/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZUdWR1pHbFdhMHBMWlZWc1IySnJSakZNVjAxNlZEQm9RbUZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15943577517523358854/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB3ZUdWR1pHbFdhMHBMWlZWc1IySnJSakZNVjAxNlZEQm9RbUZGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,9232,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20weGVGZGlWa0pLZVVsR2JrRjFMV016VDBoQmFFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x3d13cd5c5807f1b6!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm0xeFdiVkJKeUlGbkF1LWMzT0hBaEE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20weGVGZGlWa0pLZVVsR2JrRjFMV016VDBoQmFFRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20weGVGZGlWa0pLZVVsR2JrRjFMV016VDBoQmFFRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20weGVGZGlWa0pLZVVsR2JrRjFMV016VDBoQmFFRRILMGRmZjFIVkNNc1UaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tMHhlRmRpVmtKS2VV